{"asset_key":"ep5/env_story_15361165","episode":"ep5","category":"env_story","story_id":"15361165","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1536116501:1":{"text":"붉은 사냥제의 용사가 돌아오면 바로 꽃을 건네야죠!","source_cn":"等猎血节的勇士归来，第一时间送花过去呀！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0450248C1354FE87","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1536116502:1":{"text":"이건 아쿠보르에서 가장 희귀한 꽃이에요. 사냥의 신께 인정받은 용사에게 딱이죠!","source_cn":"这可是雅库伯尔最稀有的花，只有被狩猎神认可的勇士才配得上！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7DC3C02AA3BE60EC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1536116503:1":{"text":"용사들한테 꽃이 왜 필요해? 다 쓸데없는 짓이야!","source_cn":"他们要花做什么？没事找事！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC0CD6A1A654C59F9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1536116504:1":{"text":"다들 꽃을 들고 있는데 당신만 없으면, 용사를 존중하지 않는 것처럼 보일걸요?","source_cn":"别人都拿着花的时候，只有你手上没有，会显得你不尊重勇士！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD7A379B64F01F35D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1536116505:1":{"text":"그... 그럼 내가 직접 꺾어오지 뭐.","source_cn":"那……那我自己去采。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x23BAAB475E0B764A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1536116506:1":{"text":"제가 파는 것보다 예쁘지 않을 거예요! 꽃 한 송이에 토끼 가죽 한 장! 천천히 생각해 보세요~","source_cn":"你采的肯定没我这里卖的好看！一张兔皮就能换一朵，省时省力！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE6292413F204812C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1536116507:1":{"text":"알겠어, 한 송이 줘.","source_cn":"好吧，给我来一朵。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8B146C6A4F6E9953","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:羊角":{"text":"램코르누","source":"羊角","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:凯":{"text":"카이르","source":"凯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":8,"localized_text_count":7,"speaker_count":2}}